  "description": "Patchouli Of New York by Le Chameau is a refined and mysterious fragrance that reimagines the classic essence of patchouli through a minimalist yet powerful composition. Created for the confident, modern individual, this scent embodies urban sophistication with a touch of smoky allure. Top Note: Bergamot Heart Note: Jasmine Base Notes: Incense, Saffron The fragrance opens with a bright spark of bergamot, offering a fresh citrusy lift that immediately captures attention. As it transitions, the heart reveals a soft bloom of jasmine—elegant, floral, and sensual—adding a gentle touch of romance. The dry-down introduces a bold, smoldering blend of incense and saffron, creating a warm, resinous finish with exotic depth and a slightly spicy edge. Patchouli Of New York is ideal for those who appreciate a modern twist on classic notes. It’s versatile enough for everyday elegance but carries enough mystery to make a statement after dark. A signature scent for those who move through the city with quiet strength and undeniable presence.",
